unconnected with his conduct;
(vii)
withholding of increments pay of a Government Servant for his failure to pass any departmental examination in
accordance with the rules or orders governing the service to which he belongs or post which he holds or the terms of his
appointment;
(viii)
termination of the services of a Government servant appointed on probation, during or at the end of the period of his
